Z||000000||turbo86se||03-31-2001||01:14 PM||||Hi everyone, I just got a 120 cluster in the mail today from Pondski, THANKS!!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  and I need some help installing the 120 speedo in my SE (has 85). I know it's a plug and play unit, but where do I start and so forth. I'm going to put the SE 85 speedo in my soon to be running 88 coupe V6.<BR>TIA!!<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=226077&a=1676320&p=20236791"> ||||reg||5
